ur power washer. Cleaning feels even better in PowerWash Simulator 2, with enhanced soap that clings to stubborn stains and annihilates dirt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/ec26488bb1bb8630d798d83f2398e1c4.poster.avif?t=1784211271\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/ec26488bb1bb8630d798d83f2398e1c4.webm?t=1784211271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/ec26488bb1bb8630d798d83f2398e1c4.mp4?t=1784211271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clean in Split-screen!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfaction on the double! Share campaign progression online together for the first time. In addition to online play, split-screen co-op has entered the chat. Team up and take on the dirt with twice the wash-power, from the convenience of one screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/32e2bc4c3b59203fa948a3e35b75e7de.poster.avif?t=1784211271\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/32e2bc4c3b59203fa948a3e35b75e7de.webm?t=1784211271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968420/extras/32e2bc4c3b59203fa948a3e35b75e7de.mp4?t=1784211271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2025/2026 Content Roadmap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the rest of 2025, we're focusing on fixes, quality-of-life improvements, a